  "notes": "16-seed no-cap Run 2 library declustering with stitched ttbar, built off ttHbb_run2_20261003_f7183e9-cca392c (its only upstream). D.1 rebuilds the splitting library with the ttbar subtraction by its FvT_ttHbb_stitched (same FvT in D.3); M.5 makes ttbar_PSData_stitched here from TTTo*_stitched (SubSampler, seed 5); D.4/D.5 against its B.1 noJCM histograms (processor_ttHbb, 4b data + TTTo*_stitched, blinded); D.5 SvB bootstrap with SvB_ttHbb_stitched (ps = ps_ttHbb). D.6 off. Handoffs: mixeddata_all_declib16st, synthetic_data_lib16st_{4b,multijet}, ttbar_PSData_stitched. Replaces the unsubmitted declib16st_run2_20261006_be7ca0b-5caa947 (libA library, inclusive PS).",
